WEBVTT

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.980
SWORD GAI

00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:36.760
I found you.

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:41.760
I shall avenge my comrade Soin.

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:45.680
Now try to kill me. I will save your soul.

00:01:55.360 --> 00:01:57.860
Why do you fear salvation?

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:03.330
Brother! I missed you!

00:02:04.160 --> 00:02:05.000
Me too.

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:09.580
It's tough only being able
to see you once a week.

00:02:09.670 --> 00:02:12.040
I was just thinking the same thing!

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:15.300
What did you do today, Rie?

00:02:17.090 --> 00:02:21.300
They gave me an exam,
then I ate, and then...

00:02:21.390 --> 00:02:22.430
I forget.

00:02:22.850 --> 00:02:26.220
But the doctor says I'm getting better.

00:02:26.310 --> 00:02:30.810
I'll have to stay here a while longer,
but he says I'll be cured for sure!

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:32.690
I see. I'm glad.

00:02:35.110 --> 00:02:38.070
I always want to be with you, Brother.

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:41.700
And I don't like the hospital
because they do things that hurt.

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:45.040
The treatment is
to make you healthy, right?

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:48.830
I want to be with you
all the time, as well, but I can't.

00:02:49.330 --> 00:02:51.290
So please endure this, too.

00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:53.250
Okay.

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:56.840
-Hey, Brother.
-Yeah?

00:02:58.170 --> 00:03:01.090
When I get out of the hospital,
will you celebrate with me?

00:03:01.590 --> 00:03:04.600
Of course! I'll get us a cake
and a fancy meal!

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:07.220
Um, and a present, too!

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:11.600
So decide what you want
by the time I come back, okay?

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:13.230
Okay!

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:20.400
Aya.

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:26.490
Itchy!

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:29.200
Itchy!

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:34.790
Aya.

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:36.170
Aya.

00:03:38.340 --> 00:03:41.130
Marriage. Promise.

00:03:45.470 --> 00:03:46.300
There, Doctor!

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:50.930
Keep going. Keep going!

00:03:53.270 --> 00:03:54.730
Yes!

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:08.790
I'm glad you got
to see your brother yesterday.

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:09.700
Yup!

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:12.580
He really loves you, doesn't he?

00:04:13.210 --> 00:04:16.750
I know he's busy,
but he comes to see you all the time.

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:21.470
Really? Do you really think so?
Does he love me?

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:25.470
Yes, he does! I think
it's beautiful love between siblings.

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:26.850
I see!

00:04:27.220 --> 00:04:29.010
Are you having fun today, Rie?

00:04:29.100 --> 00:04:29.970
Yup!

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:34.230
But maybe it would be more fun
if Sayori and Shoko were here.

00:04:36.310 --> 00:04:39.190
But of course it's fun just being
with you, too!

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:41.610
Because I like you, Doctor!

00:04:41.690 --> 00:04:43.610
Thanks, that makes me happy.

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:47.450
I love you and brother
and Shoko and Sayori!

00:04:48.740 --> 00:04:51.750
You're a good girl. You really are.

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:55.170
I know. Let's go get some ice cream!

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:56.500
Okay!

00:05:01.090 --> 00:05:03.970
Hey, Doctor. Where are we going?

00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:10.930
I'll give you something better
than ice cream.

00:05:11.890 --> 00:05:13.480
I'll take this off for you.

00:05:22.820 --> 00:05:26.610
Azoth is still on the run.
We need an immediate response.

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:29.660
Please give me permission
to send more Crysali.

00:05:29.740 --> 00:05:31.370
There's no need.

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:33.200
What do you mean?

00:05:33.290 --> 00:05:35.660
You are only to observe this matter.

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:38.790
Why? The number
of victims keep increasing.

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:41.750
We're the only ones
who can fight the Busoma.

00:05:42.210 --> 00:05:43.630
It's for the greater good.

00:05:43.960 --> 00:05:48.640
Greater good? Isn't our "greater good"
saving defenseless people?

00:05:49.090 --> 00:05:50.930
We have another plan.

00:05:51.470 --> 00:05:52.430
But--

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:56.230
This discussion is over, Kagami. Leave.

00:05:57.690 --> 00:05:58.520
Yes sir.

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:36.020
Why am I here?

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:45.610
Father...

00:07:03.590 --> 00:07:05.340
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:07:06.880 --> 00:07:09.590
What's the situation?
Put it on the main monitor now.

00:07:10.050 --> 00:07:13.680
Yes ma'am. The Busoma Azoth
continues travel without rest.

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:16.850
It's presently in
the forest park of sector D.

00:07:17.850 --> 00:07:18.770
The park, huh?

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:21.520
-Show me video.
-Yes ma'am.

00:07:26.820 --> 00:07:27.650
Aya!

00:07:29.240 --> 00:07:33.370
You promised me.
That you'd m-marry me.

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:35.620
L-Let me go.

00:07:35.950 --> 00:07:39.330
See? The p-preparations are done.

00:07:39.410 --> 00:07:41.870
-Let's go to the chur--
-Let me go!

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:45.210
Y-You promised.

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:48.880
S-So why?

00:07:49.590 --> 00:07:52.720
As such, he keeps talking about marriage.

00:07:53.130 --> 00:07:55.220
<i>Itchy!</i>

00:07:56.010 --> 00:07:58.390
Is he not a perfect Busoma?

00:07:58.970 --> 00:08:03.020
He's clearly different
from the others we've seen.

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:06.980
His weapon isn't a normal Sage Alma.

00:08:07.610 --> 00:08:10.440
It's a special one,
with the devil Beelzebub inside.

00:08:10.820 --> 00:08:16.070
So maybe, even though he's a Busoma,
his form is slightly different than usual.

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:18.080
What do you mean?

00:08:18.700 --> 00:08:22.330
Fragments of his memories
of when he was a human are still there.

00:08:22.960 --> 00:08:25.290
And he's pursuing them.

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:27.460
His memories?

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:29.050
Administrator,

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:34.760
there've been no new victims because Azoth
is in his human form, but at this rate...

00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:37.220
Please issue an order to send a Crysalis.

00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:42.060
Permission will not be given.

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:46.150
-Continue observing.
-Roger!

00:08:52.320 --> 00:08:54.650
Hey! Lovely weather, isn't it?

00:08:55.030 --> 00:08:57.820
Children playing,
light dancing through the leaves.

00:08:57.910 --> 00:09:00.910
I'd love to sketch it all if I could.

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:04.580
It's the perfect day for a walk!

00:09:06.710 --> 00:09:09.670
Would you have preferred
someplace else, Ogata?

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:11.630
A movie, perhaps?

00:09:12.340 --> 00:09:14.090
No, this is fine.

00:09:14.170 --> 00:09:15.340
I'm glad.

00:09:16.010 --> 00:09:19.180
This park is one of my favorite spots.

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:22.560
My little sister Rie's hospital
is near here.

00:09:23.060 --> 00:09:27.190
I always come here on my way back.
This place has pretty scenery, right?

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:30.440
When Rie's condition wasn't good,

00:09:30.520 --> 00:09:33.150
the beautiful green here
would make me feel better.

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:37.410
That's why I wanted to bring you here.

00:09:38.240 --> 00:09:39.160
Matoba...

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:40.990
Thank you.

00:09:41.740 --> 00:09:42.580
No problem.

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:46.370
<i>Okay, looking good!</i>

00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:53.460
<i>The conversation's so natural,
<i>she won't realize I've been up all night!</i></i>

00:09:55.050 --> 00:09:57.800
<i>But Ogata is the same as ever.</i>

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:00.760
<i>What is she thinking?</i>

00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:03.220
<i>That k-ki...</i>

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:08.770
M-Matoba? What's wrong?

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:10.560
Nothing!

00:10:10.650 --> 00:10:13.360
The trees are so beautiful,
it's like they're talking!

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:16.690
The world is just so amazing
and wonderful, I...

00:10:19.820 --> 00:10:21.740
You're such an artist, Matoba.

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:27.210
Really! Really!

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:28.830
Right?

00:10:33.550 --> 00:10:35.590
What? Is Kishimoto asleep?

00:10:35.670 --> 00:10:37.220
Is Kishimoto okay?

00:10:49.690 --> 00:10:50.600
What's wrong?

00:10:51.440 --> 00:10:52.690
I don't want to go back.

00:10:53.770 --> 00:10:57.490
Good girls wouldn't say that.
Your friends are waiting.

00:10:57.820 --> 00:11:00.860
If I go back to the hospital,
I can't go outside again.

00:11:00.950 --> 00:11:02.660
They'll do a lot of painful things.

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:04.120
Rie...

00:11:04.910 --> 00:11:06.870
It's for your own good.

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:10.000
I want to play more!
I want to be with Brother more!

00:11:14.500 --> 00:11:16.670
Don't cause too many problems
for me, okay?

00:11:20.170 --> 00:11:21.010
Rie!

00:11:23.720 --> 00:11:25.560
What a pain.

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:31.140
The weather's so great!

00:11:31.730 --> 00:11:34.110
You've said that five times, Matoba.

00:11:35.320 --> 00:11:36.770
Is it?

00:11:38.070 --> 00:11:39.070
Is something wrong?

00:11:39.490 --> 00:11:40.320
N-No.

00:11:40.990 --> 00:11:44.160
Um, Ogata, about yesterday...

00:11:44.240 --> 00:11:45.120
Yesterday?

00:11:46.030 --> 00:11:49.870
Yeah. In other words, are we dat--

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:53.960
-Rie!
-Matoba?

00:11:54.040 --> 00:11:55.840
Sorry. I'll be right back!

00:12:06.470 --> 00:12:08.140
Aya...

00:12:09.310 --> 00:12:11.640
Why won't you marry me?

00:12:12.140 --> 00:12:14.940
Y-Y-You promised.

00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:19.650
Aya! Keep your promise!
Let's get married!

00:12:20.150 --> 00:12:21.070
Married?

00:12:21.150 --> 00:12:23.240
Yes, we have to marry.

00:12:23.320 --> 00:12:25.950
Okay! I have a ring too!

00:12:27.990 --> 00:12:29.410
R-Really?

00:12:29.830 --> 00:12:32.540
If we get married,
my brother will come too, right?

00:12:32.620 --> 00:12:34.420
Yeah, I'm sure he will!

00:12:38.380 --> 00:12:39.550
<i>Did I imagine it?</i>

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:42.590
<i>No, that was definitely Rie.</i>

00:12:43.760 --> 00:12:45.680
-Um, excuse me.
-Yes?

00:12:46.590 --> 00:12:50.010
Have you seen this girl?
It's my little sister.

00:12:50.770 --> 00:12:55.690
Oh, I just saw her running that way
with a strange man.

00:12:56.230 --> 00:12:57.310
A man?

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:14.080
You're wasting your time, Busoma.

00:13:27.050 --> 00:13:28.300
Now, come!

00:13:40.480 --> 00:13:42.110
Miserable human!

00:13:43.610 --> 00:13:46.240
Next time, I will take your body!

00:13:46.860 --> 00:13:49.570
Life of this weapon, sleep within me.

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:04.260
Excuse me.

00:14:04.960 --> 00:14:05.800
Come in.

00:14:09.970 --> 00:14:14.560
This is Sato.
He'll be your new assistant, sir.

00:14:14.890 --> 00:14:16.100
Nice to meet you.

00:14:23.110 --> 00:14:26.110
Alright, I have an important job for you.

00:14:35.410 --> 00:14:36.830
Um, can I help y--

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:39.290
-Please marry us.
-Huh?

00:14:39.500 --> 00:14:42.290
Make us married, immediately!

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:45.050
I-I can't just do it, so--

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:46.210
Please!

00:14:46.300 --> 00:14:48.630
But we don't even marry people.

00:14:48.720 --> 00:14:49.550
Please!

00:14:50.010 --> 00:14:52.550
I have a ring! This is for love!

00:14:53.430 --> 00:14:54.260
Okay.

00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:58.430
I'll do what I can.

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:05.230
Where am I?

00:15:14.780 --> 00:15:16.240
Don't cry.

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:17.700
Sir?

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:21.210
I'll give you what you want right now.

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:24.540
S-Sir...

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:26.050
What are you...

00:15:31.590 --> 00:15:34.890
It is the instinct of a weapon
to seek human blood.

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:12.510
Marcus Lithos,

00:16:13.180 --> 00:16:16.600
do you promise to love
and treasure this woman,

00:16:16.680 --> 00:16:20.480
for richer or for poorer,
in sickness and in health?

00:16:21.230 --> 00:16:22.060
I do.

00:16:22.890 --> 00:16:24.060
Rie Matoba.

00:16:24.480 --> 00:16:28.610
Do you promise to love
and treasure this man, for richer--

00:16:28.690 --> 00:16:29.940
Where's brother?

00:16:31.190 --> 00:16:33.070
Ignore her, please.

00:16:33.860 --> 00:16:36.490
This was very sudden
and she's just a little confused.

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:39.120
-But..
-Continue, now!

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:42.870
Do you promise to love him,

00:16:42.960 --> 00:16:45.540
for richer or for poorer,
in sickness and in health?

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:49.340
What's wrong? Hurry and say "yes."

00:16:50.090 --> 00:16:52.590
If brother's not coming,
I'm not getting married.

00:16:52.670 --> 00:16:54.680
Just say "Yes!"

00:16:54.760 --> 00:16:56.720
I won't! I mean it.

00:16:57.180 --> 00:16:58.390
You...

00:16:59.930 --> 00:17:01.720
Itchy!

00:17:01.810 --> 00:17:03.640
Itchy!

00:17:04.310 --> 00:17:06.150
Itchy!

00:17:08.360 --> 00:17:09.480
A-A devil!

00:17:14.530 --> 00:17:17.200
P-Please stop... Please!

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:29.840
Let's get married!

00:17:30.340 --> 00:17:32.710
I have the ring!

00:17:37.050 --> 00:17:37.890
Rie!

00:17:39.760 --> 00:17:41.890
-Brother!
-Rie, this way!

00:17:42.470 --> 00:17:43.310
Okay!

00:17:48.940 --> 00:17:49.770
Rie!

00:17:53.820 --> 00:17:54.650
Brother!

00:18:01.280 --> 00:18:03.660
I love you!

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:05.160
Stop!

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:08.580
Stay away from Rie!

00:18:13.420 --> 00:18:14.260
Brother!

00:18:14.340 --> 00:18:15.170
Oww...

00:18:16.630 --> 00:18:17.470
Stop it!

00:18:18.010 --> 00:18:20.050
Let me go! Let me go!

00:18:20.760 --> 00:18:23.180
Stop it! Not Rie.

00:18:36.860 --> 00:18:37.860
The Shiryu...

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:53.040
Shin Matoba.

00:18:54.210 --> 00:18:55.960
Become my sheath.

00:18:57.420 --> 00:18:59.010
Shiryu, why?

00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:03.300
It is your destiny, and mine.

00:19:05.100 --> 00:19:05.970
I...

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:30.330
Brother!

00:19:35.630 --> 00:19:37.090
Save me, brother!

00:20:02.820 --> 00:20:03.740
Aya...

00:20:26.720 --> 00:20:27.600
Lady Himiko.

00:20:29.310 --> 00:20:32.560
Welcome back. Are you hurt?

00:20:34.440 --> 00:20:35.270
No.

00:20:38.980 --> 00:20:40.650
How is that man doing?

00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:45.410
The man who came to us a while ago.

00:20:46.280 --> 00:20:49.540
He's begun a new type of training.

00:20:51.620 --> 00:20:52.460
I see.
